<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Matengo Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Aloma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua jaka Pauli kwa Aloma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Aloma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Alo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua jaka Pauli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Aloma</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu sa Aloma jiandikwi nu ntumi Pauli kuwesikana kati ja saka 54 au 58 baada jukusaliwa Yesu Kilisitu. Pauli jwabia ngasejuhikiki ku Loma henu jwaandika kitabu hesi ili kwaapwagi bandu buku Loma boti yani Ayaudi na banga Ayaudi kuhusu Kilisitu. Jwaandika balua heji ku musi uku Kolintu kojwabia jutamiki masoba masokopi. Pauli jwaandika ili bandu ba ndema yoti bunhobalia nukunzetake Yesu Kilisitu, mu lipungu 16:26.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu sa Aloma ndi kitabu su muhimu kwa bandu babunhobale Kilisitu kila pandu na kila kipindi ndaba Pauli juandiki hotuhotu na juhelasi sapi uokopu gotuwesa kupata kupete Yesu Kilisitu. Pauli kabee jujonganisi Lijambu la Amboni laka Yesu Kilisitu ni Lilaganu la Mwandi. Asomi bingi apwaga ana nsitali nkolongu mukitabu hesi gupwaga mulipungu la 1:16 gupwaga,“Nepani ngamoni iyoni kulandi Lijambu la Amboni laka Kilisitu, ndaba lenieli ndi makili gaka Sapanga gakaagombo bandu boti baahobale, kutumbuli Ayaudi hoti mbaki bandu ba nndema yoti.” Pandu pu utumbuli pi kitabu senze kutumbuli sula 1-12 jitweli malobi ga siolojia na, pandu pa pili kutumbuli sula ja 13-15 jilongali majambu gu kuhenga bandu paakuba ajongini ni Kilisitu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabii nkati</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli jutumbuli balua jaki su kulilongulake mweni nu kupwaga jombi ndi jojwaandiki. Lipungu la 1:1-15.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabee Pauli jaandika kupwaga mundu hejubii na uokopu goguwesikana kupata kupete Yesu Kilisitu. Linga mu lipungu la 1:16-11:36.</para>
  <para style="io">Baada jahaga Pauli jwaalagalaki namuna jukutama paakuba ajongini ni Kilisitu. Lipungu la 12:1-15:13.</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli jujomuli kuandika kitabu sa Loma senu sa kwaalamuki bandu babunhobale Kilisitu buku Loma. Lipungu la 16.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Nepani Pauli ntumisi waka Yesu Kilisitu, nunhandaki balua jenze. Sapanga junhagwi kuba ntumisi nukunhenga nandila Lijambu la Amboni lejumbeki Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>Pamwandi Sapanga jwaalagila bandu Lijambu la Amboni lende kupete alota baka Sapanga ngati hekuandikwi mu Maandiku gaka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>Lijambu la Amboni lende lunndongale Mwana waka Sapanga, ndi Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu jojwasaliwa ki nhyega mulukolu lwaka Daudi, <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>jojuwe kupete usapi waki na kwa makili gaka Loho jaka Sapanga, jwalangiswa kuba mwana waka Sapanga kupete kuyoka kwaki yani Yesu Kilisitu Bambu witu. <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>Nukupete jombi, ne jumbeki wamboni waka Sapanga nguba nuntumi, ili kupete jombi naalongulakia bandu ba ndema yoka anhobalia nukunzetake Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>Mwanganya montama ku Loma kabee mmbi nkati ja bandu haba, ankemiki mmbia mwabandu baka Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>Ndienu nunhandaki mwanganya mwaboti mwentama ku Loma mwee mwabandu bampalika na Sapanga, na ankemiki mmbia mwabandu baki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Tunndobee waamboni waka Sapanga nu lukwali kuhuma kwaka Sapanga Atati bitu na kwaka Bambu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kunsengu Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>Kabula ja goka nunsengu Sapanga wangu kupete Yesu Kilisitu ndaba jinu mwanganya, ndaba kuhobale kwinu kujogwaneka kila pandu pundema pani. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Sapanga jo nuntumaki kwa mwoju wangu goti pa nandi Lijambu la Amboni laka Mwana waki ndi jojumona nukunyoana ndaba jumanya ndenda kunkomboka mwanganya, <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>masoba goa panunndoba Sapanga. Nundoba Sapanga ana jupai, jumbekia napwasi ja sapi jukuika kwinu kwa masoba gani. <verse eid="ROM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Ndaba ndokule ngamaa kummbona mwanganya ili mbata napwasi juku mmbaguli nhupi ja loho ili mmbia nganganganga. <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>Sembala mmanya senze, mwanganya na nepani twitenda kugangamalisana moju, kuhobale kwangu nepani kwanzangatia mwanganya nukuhobale kwinu mwanganya kwinyangatia nepani.<verse eid="ROM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Mwaalongu bangu, mbala mmanya mala jingi napala kuhika kwinu, lakini mbaka sajenu atei kumbenga. Napai ngamaa kuhika ili nhwesa kunzangati mwanganya ili nngangamala mukuhobale, ngati henaajangatia bandu bangi bandema yoti. <verse eid="ROM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Ndaba leniheli lihengu lango, kwaalandi bandu boti, bandu baasomiki na banga kusoma, bandu bana malangu na banga malangu. <verse eid="ROM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Ndaba ndokule ngama kunndandi Lijambu la Amboni kwinu mwanganya kabee mombi ku Loma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Makili gi Lijambu la Amboni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>Nepani ngamoni iyoni kulandi Lijambu la Amboni laka Kilisitu, ndaba lenieli ndi makili gaka Sapanga gakaagombo bandu boti baahobale, kutumbuli Ayaudi hoti mbaki bandu ba nndema yoti. <verse eid="ROM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>Ndaba Lijambu la Amboni lilangi sapi namuna Sapanga hejwaajetake bandu kuba baamboni palongi jaki. Lijambu lee heli lihengeka sukuhobale, tumbuka puwanzu mbaka pamwisu, ngati Malobi gaka Sapanga egapwaga, “Mundu jwa amboni palongi jaka Sapanga jwitama kupete kuhobale.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Likosa la bandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Ndaba inyela yaka Sapanga jilangiswi kuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga banga kunzogopa jombi na abaja boka baapenga usakaka kupete uliya. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Ndaba goti majambu gagunhenga Sapanga jumanyikana kwabu gabonakini ndaba Sapanga weni jwaalangi pangwendu. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Tumbuka Sapanga pa jwabomba nndema, makili gaki ga yaka petapeta nu ukolongu waki hata ngati ngase ubonikana kwa mihu, lakini gabonikana kupete hindu yejubombiki. Henu ngabiiwesi kulikengale kwi indela jokapi. <verse eid="ROM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/>Hata ngati bummanya Sapanga lakini ngase bundumbali wala kunsengula ngati hekupalika. Badala jaki, mawasu gabu gabiya ganga na mana na mioju jabu jatweli lwiye. <verse eid="ROM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>Awasali abii na malangu lakini ngaseabii na malango. <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/>Akotoka kundumbali Sapanga jojutama yaka petapeta, badala jaki alumbali imong'umong'u yealenganaki kuba ngati mundu jojukua, yeyuye ibi ngati bandu, inyama yeibeleka, ijuni, au iumbi yeikwaba.<verse eid="ROM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Ndaba jahela, Sapanga jwaalekiki apwata kutokule kwiliya mu myoju jabu nukuhengane majambu giiyoni mu nhyega jabu. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Ang'anambwi usakaka waka Sapanga kuba isoli, bikigungamali nukuhitumaki hindu yejubombiki Sapanga nukunndeka Sapanga jojubombiki, jojupalika kulumbaliwa yaka petapeta, Amina.<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Ndienu Sapanga jwaalei apwata kutogule kwabu kwiiyoni. Hata haka mbomba bakotuka kugone na aka alomi babu ngati Sapanga hejabombiki, nukutokule kugone nakambomba ajabu. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Akanalomi nabombi ahelahe akotoka kugone nakambomba nukugone na akanalomi ajaki. Ahenga mahengu giiyoni, kupete kuhenga hela bililete beni mang'aliku ga apalika kupata ndaba jukuhenga mahengu mabaja.<verse eid="ROM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Ngati bandu heakaniki kuba na Sapanga, najombi Sapanga jwaalekiti apwata malangu gabu giliya, jwaalekiki aheenga ganga kupalika kuhenga. <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>Atwelii kila uliya na wii gwakila namuna juubaja na soju na ugoni na kukomana. Atwelii wipu na kukoma na isoli na kutokule kuliya nu kugamba, <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>nu kwa akakopakangane bandu isoli na babunsuki Sapanga na baatondoka na baabi ni ing'omu kabee atenda kukipuna atonga majambu giliya, banga kwaajetake ahengo na amabu babu. <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>Ang'ang'a na banga kuhobaleka na banga kuba nu upali na banga ni ikiya kwa bandu bangi na banga kuhenga sealagi beni kuhenga. <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>Amanyi malagalaki gaka Sapanga gapwaga bandu baatenda majambu ngati haga, apalika kuwa. Ganiaga ngase atenda pee beni ila kabee baajetake bangi baatenda majambu ngati haga.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kutemu kwaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>Henu unkosi wangu ana untemu bandu bangi, ngaguwesi kulikengale, hata ngati gukubi wanya. Ndaba, hewaatemu bangi, ulipeke yaambamba wamweti ndaba na weapa gutenda majambu agalagala gagutemu. <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>Tumanya kutemu kwaka Sapanga kwa bandu baatenda majambu ngati haga ndi kutemu kwa sakaka. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Lakini unkosi wangu weapa we waatemu bandu baatenda majambu ngati haga koni na wamweti uhenga majambu ngati gagaga, boo, uwasali lee wiijepa kutemuliwa na Sapanga? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Au lee uhulongama waamboni waki nkolongo, na kuinakali kwaki nukulendale kwaki sanga kumanya boo, waamboni waka Sapanga hogu utulongo kujetake mahakau nukugaleka? <verse eid="ROM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Lakini ndaba jii ng'omu na mioju jii janga kupala kujetake mahakau na kugaleka, nahenu mulibeke mwabeti mang'aliku gingi lisoba laka Sapanga inyela yaki nu kutemu kwaki ngati hejupala mweni kwiitenda kubonikana. <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/>Lisoba leheli Sapanga anndepa kila mundu kulengana na sejuhengi gaki. <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>Bandu bahenga majambu gaamboni sangakusoka koni ataputa ulumbi kuhuma kwaka Sapanga ni isima na womi wanga na mwisu, Sapanga jwaapekia womi wa masoba goti. <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>Lakini bangi baapwata majambu gabu beni na baakana usakaka waka Sapanga nukupwata ubaja, sakaka Sapanga jwaatemula kwii nyela yaki ngolongu. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Mang'aliku nu ubini gampata mundu jokapi jojutenda ulia. Gaapata hoti Ayaudi mbaka bandu banga Ayaudi kabee. <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Lakini Sapanga jaapekia ulumbi ni isima nu lukwali bandu boti baatenda majambu ga amboni, jwaapekia Ayaudi hoti na bandu banga Ayaudi kabee. <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/>Ndaba Sapanga ngase jujangati bandu boti sukubagu bangi.<verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Bandu boti baatei mahakau sanga kugamanya Malagalaki gaka Musa biikuwa sukutemuliwa bila Malagalaki, na baatei mahakau koni amanya Malagalaki, biitemuliwa kupete malagalaki. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Ndaba nga bandu baajogwane pe Malagalaki gaka Musa ndi abonekana baamboni kwaka Sapanga, ila bandu baajetake Malagalaki ndi babibonikana baamboni palongi jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Bandu Banga Ayaudi ngaseabi na Malagalaki gaka Musa, lakini paahenga ngati egapalika Malagalaki sukulongoswa na mioju jabu, bombi akuba ndi Malagalaki hata ngati ngaseagamanyi Malagalaki gaka Musa. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Bombi alangi sekipalika mu Malagalaki gagaandikwi mu myoju jabu, koni moju wabu ulangi lijambu leheli, ndaba mawasu gabu mala jingi gatenda kwaataki na mala jengi gatenda kwaakengale. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Henu, kupete Lijambu la Amboni lenandi nepani ndi hekwiibia lisoba lela Sapanga pajwiitemula kupete Yesu Kilisitu majambu gaahengiki bandu pu ujobu.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ayaudi na Malagalaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Henu boo wehapa? Wehapa, ana ulikema wamweti Nhyaudi, guhobale Malagalaki gaka Musa nukukipuni kuba mwana waka Sapanga, <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>kupete Malagalaki gaka Musa ugamanyi gajupala Sapanga kabee guwesa kuhagu majambu gaamboni. <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>Ulimanya wehapa ukilongosi wa bandu banga kulinga na wehapa unang'anu wa bandu baabii palwii, <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>ulibona weapa gu mmbola wa bandu ang'ang'a nu mbola wa bana akeke ndaba nhwasali mu malagaliki mbii na umanyi nu usakaka. <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>Henu weapa, gwaabola bangi ndaba jaki ngase gulibole wamwete? Wehapa walandi bangi biijiba na wamweti gutenda kujiba. <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>Weapa gupwaga, “Mundu jwiitenda ugoni,” koni wamwe utenda ugoni. Gusuki imong'umong'u yi isapanga ndaba jaki wamweti gujingi nukujiba mali gingi mu nyumba ji isapanga. <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>Weapa weukipuna ugamanyi Malagalaki gaka Sapanga lakini umpoa Sapanga lihamu sukukotoka kuhenga ngati malagalaki hegapala? <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/>Ngati Maandiku gaka Sapanga hegapwaga, “Bandu banga Ayaudi alitondwi liina laka Sapanga ndaba ja majambu ganhenga mwa Ayaudi mwanganya.”<verse eid="ROM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Kuseku jandu kwaku kwiibia kwasakaka ana gujetake Malagalaki, lakini ana ngasegutenda ngati Malagalaki hegapala, kuseku jandu kwaku kukuba ngati mundu jwanga kusekujandu. Ndienu mbanga wakahigali sanga kuseku jandu. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Ana bandu banga Ayaudi banga kuseku jandu ahenga gagapalika mu Malagalaki, boo, kutama bila kuseku jandu kwabu ngase kubonikana le ngati asekwi jando? <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Henu bandu banga Ayaudi bantemula mweapa mwa Ayaudi mwensekwi jandu nukugamanya Malagalaki gaka Sapanga ana ngasenhenga ngati Malagalaki hegapala. <verse eid="ROM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Ndaba nga kila mundu jojubonikana kunza kuba Nhyaudi ndi Nhyaudi wa sakaka kabee mundu ngasejukuba nhyaudi wasakaka ati ndaba jusekwi jandu nhyega. <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/>Nhyaudi wa sakaka ndi mundu jojubi nhyaudi nkati, ndi jojusekwi jandu mu moju. Ganiaga ndi majambu gu mu loho, na nga majambu gagabi mu maandiku gagabi mu Malagalaki. Mundu ngati hoju ngase jupata ulumbi kuhuma kwa bandu ila ulumbi kuhuma kwaka Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Nhyaudi jubii na sindu boo kikolongu kupeta bandu bangi? Au boo, Ayaudi baajonzuki sindu boo ngani kupete kuseku jandu? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Hena, Kibii sekijonzukeka kila upandi. Sapanga jatumbulia oti kwaapeke Ayaudi malobi gaki. <verse eid="ROM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Henu kwibia boo, ana bangi babu akotwiki kunhobale Sapanga? Boo, kukotoka kuhobale kwabu kwiiboa lee kuhobaleka kwaka Sapanga? <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>Ngaela! Sapanga juigali kuba jojuhobaleka masoba goka hata ngati kila mundu julonge isoli. Ngati hegapwaga Maandiku gaka Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">“Kila hegulonge, malobi gaku gakubaa ga sakaka, pa witemuliwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">wehapa ndi wibia we guwesa.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Ana mahakau gitu galangi Sapanga jutenda gaamboni, henu twiipwaga bole? Boo, ana jututemwi twiipwaga lee Sapanga jutenda liya. Pamba nonge kwa mawasu gikimundu. <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Ngahela! Nakwakabii hela Sapanga jwakawesa boo kwa atemu bandu bu punndema?<verse eid="ROM 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Mundu juwesa kupwaga ana, “Ana isoli yangu ijangati kulangi usakaka waka Sapanga nukujonzuke ulumbi waki, henu ndaba jaki nepani andemu kuba namundu mwana mahakao?” <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Kulengana nukupwaga ana, tuhenga majambu giliya ili tupata gaamboni! Ndi bangi hebututondula sukututaki tupwagiki hela. Biitemuliwa ngati hekupalika.<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngamundu jwaamboni palongi jaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Henu tupwaga kike? Boo, twa Ayaudi lee twaamboni kupeta bandu bange? Ngahela! Ndaba anangi kupwaga Ayaudi na bandu banga Ayaudi boka abii pai ja makili ja na mahakau. <verse eid="ROM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>Ngati maandiku gaka Sapanga hegapwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">“Ngamundu hata jumu jwaamboni palongi jaka Sapanga,<verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>nga mundu jumwa jwana malangu wala ngakuba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">mundu hata jumu joantaputa Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>Boti atei kung'anambuka boti atei kukosa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">nga jojutenda gaamboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">ngasejubii hata jumu.<verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>Milomu jabu jibii ngati matenge gaayekwi gaganunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">ni ilimi yabu ilonge isoli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">mu milomu jabu gapita malobi gana sumu ngati gi lijoka.<verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>Malobi ga alonge gatweli yaambamba nu usungu.<verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>Magolu gabu gajojuke kukoma bandu.<verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>Pokapi pa ajenda aleta ling'ai nuku kuhalabana hindu.<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>Ngaseamanyi kutama su lukwali.”<verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>“Ngase bunzogopa Sapanga hata kidogu.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>“Henu tumanyiki ana malobi goka gagalongi mu Malagalaki gaka Musa, gaapwaga bandu boti baalongoswa na Malagalaki ili kila mundu jiiwesa kulikengale, ili kulangi bandu boti apalika kutemuliwa na Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Henu nga mundu hata jumu jojubalangiwa kuba jwaamboni palongi jaka Sapanga sukukamulaki Malagalaki, ndaba Malagalaki gehaga gunzangati mundu kumanya ana juhengiki mahakau.”<verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kujetakewa na Sapanga kukuhobale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Lakini henu indela jaka Sapanga ja kwaajetake bandu kuba baamboni palongi jaki jibonikini pangwendu, kabee bila kugahenga Malagalaki. Malagalaki gagaandikwi na Musa na Alota baka Sapanga alongale lijambu leheli. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>Sapanga jwaajetake bandu kuba baamboni kwi indela jukunhobale Yesu Kilisitu. Sapanga jutenda ela kwa boka babunhobale Kilisitu ndaba ngasejibi tofauti kati ja Ayaudi na bandu banga Ayaudi. <verse eid="ROM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>Bandu boka atei mahakau nukupongukewa nu ulumbi waka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>Lakini kupete waamboni wa bwaka waka Sapanga bandu boti ajetakeka ku kuba baamboni palongi jaka Sapanga kupete Yesu Kilisitu jojwaakombwi. <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>Sapanga ampia Yesu Kilisitu kwa mwai waki ili jubia indela ja kwaalekake bandu mahakau gabu kwa mwai waki kupete kunhobale jombi. Sapanga jwatenda hela ili kulangi jombi jwaamboni. Kabula jukukuwa Kilisitu Sapanga jwatenda kuhinakali bila kulingali mahakau ga bandu. <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>Lakini henu Sapanga ampia mwana waki ili kwaalangi bandu aina ja wamboni gogujetakeka palongi jaki. Kwi indela heji Sapanga mweni julangi jombi jwaamboni na kabee antenda kila mundu joanhobale Yesu jubia jwaamboni palongi jaki.<verse eid="ROM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Henu tuwesa kukipunii kike? Ngasekibile! Ndaba jaki? Boo, nndaba jukugahenge lihengu Malagalaki gaka Musa? Ngahela! Ila ndaba tutenda kuhobale Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Henu tumanya Sapanga anzetake mundu kuba jwaamboni palongi jaki kupete kuhobale kwaki, ila nga kukuhenga gagapalika mu Malagalaki gaka Musa. <verse eid="ROM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Au boo, Sapanga ndi Sapanga waka Ayaudi pena, au Sapanga wa bandu ba ndema yoka kabee? Heena, Sapanga wa bandu banga Ayaudi boti kabee. <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>Sapanga jubi jumu pena, najombi jwaatenda bandu Ayaudi na bandu ba nndema joti abia baamboni kupete kuhobale kwabu. <verse eid="ROM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Henu boo, tugaleke Malagalaki gaka Musa ndaba jukuhobalela? Ngahela ila tugajemale Malagalaki gaka Musa kulangi ga sakaka.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s">Lilenganu lukuhobale kwaka Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Boo, henu tupwaga kike kuhusu atati bitu Ibulahimu? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>Ana Ibulahimu jwabii bunhengiki kuba jwaamboni palongi jaka Sapanga kupete mahengu gaki mweni, nala jubii na sindu sukukipuni lakini nga palongi jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>Ndaba Maandiku gaka Sapanga gapwaga, “Ibulahimu anhobalia Sapanga, najombi Sapanga anzetakia kuba waamboni palongi jaki.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Mundu jojuhenga lihengu kwaka mundu julepwa malepu, malepu gaki nga nhupi yake ila sindu sejupalika kulepwa kwi lihengu lejuhengiki. <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Lakini mundu jwanga kuhobale mahengu gaki mweni, ila anhobale Sapanga jojwaalekake bandu baatende mahakau, henu Sapanga jukubona kuhobale kwaka mundu hoju nukunzetake kuba jwaamboni palongi jaki. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Daudi kabee jwapwaga ahelahe pajwalongalia kutogule kwaka mundu jojuwe Sapanga ambona jwaamboni palongi jaki sanga kulingali mahengu gaki:<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>“Apengaliwi bandu baalekakiwi makosa gabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">babube mahakau gabu atei kugaputa.<verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>Jupengaliwi mundu jojuwe mahakau gaki Bambu nga juga komboke.”<verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Boo, kutogule hoku apata bandu baasekwi jandu pena au apata na bandu banga kuseku jando? Apata na bandu banga kuseku jandu kabee. Ndaba tupwagiki, “Ibulahimu jwatenda kuhobale na Sapanga jwatenda kunzetake kuba jwaamboni palongi jaki” <verse eid="ROM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Boo, Ibulahimu jwajetakiwa na Sapanga kipindi bole? Kabula jukuseku jando, au baada jukuseku jandu? Kabula jukuseku jandu, na nga baada jukuseku jando. <verse eid="ROM 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>Ibulahimu jwasekula jandu mwenikatai, nukuseku jandu kwe hoku kwabii nginyuli jejalangia Sapanga anzetaki jombi kuba jwaamboni palongi jaki ndaba jukuhobale kwaki kojwabi naku kabula jukuseku jandu. Henu, Ibulahimu jubi ndi atati ba bandu boti babube, hata na ngaseasekwi jandu, bunhobale Sapanga nukuhengwa kuba baamboni palongi jaki. <verse eid="ROM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>Jombi kabee atati ba bandu baasekwi jandu, lakini nga ndaba atei kuseku jandu pee, ila ndaba apwata indela ajelajela jukuhobalela jebabia apwata atati bitu Ibulahimu kabula jukuseku jandu.<verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilagi laka Sapanga bilijopa sukuhobale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>Sapanga andagila Ibulahimu nikibeleku saki kupwaga ampekia ndema joti jakakuba jabu. Lilagii heli ngaselahengiki ndaba Ibulahimu jwagapwata malagalaki gaka Musa, ila ndaba jwatenda kuhobalela, nukujetake kuba jwaamboni palongi jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>Ndaba ana babiipata Malagi gaka Sapanga pena ndi bandu baajetake malagalaki gaka Musa pena nala kuhobale ngasekubii na mana jokape, nakwombi kulagi kwaka Sapanga nga sindo. <verse eid="ROM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>Malagalaki galeta inyela, lakini na ngakuba malagalaki, ngakukubi na makosa.<verse eid="ROM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>Kwa ndaba heji, lilaganu lihika kwa ndela jukuhobale, henu lilaganu heli ndi nhupi yaka Sapanga, na henu lilaganu heli ndi nginyuli jejilangi usakaka lilaganu heli ndi li kibeleku soka saka Ibulahimu, nga kwa bandu babagakamulaki malagalaki gaka Musa, ila kabee na kwa bandu baatama kupete kuhobale ngati Ibulaimu. Jombi ndi atati bitu twaboti. <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/>Ngati maandiku gaka Sapanga hegapwaga, “Nugubei gubia gwa atati ba bandu ba ndema yoti.” Malagi haga ndi sakaka palongi jaka Sapanga joampwagila Ibulaimu, Sapanga jojwaayoa bandu, nukupete mihilu yaki, jwiihenga hindu yoka yeyabii ngaseibii ibiya. <verse eid="ROM 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>Hata ngati ngasekwabi na sindu sokapi sesunhenga Ibulahimu kuhobale lilaganu heli, lakini Ibulahimu anhobalea Sapanga nukulendale lilaganu heli na bunhenga kuba atati ba bandu ba makabila gingi, ngati hebunndagila kupwaga, “Kibeleku saku kiikuba kingi ngamaa ngati ndondu.” <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/>Jwabii hokomundu jojuhegale kuba na yaka mia jimu, lakini kuhobale kwaki ngase kwakotwike hata mweni jwamanyiki ngase juwesa kupapa ndaba jabii nseja ngamaa, nu nhwanu waki Sala yaka yaki yukubeleka mwana yabia ipetiki. <verse eid="ROM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>Ibulahimu ngase jakotwiki kuhobale na ngase jwaabii nikiholu kupete lilaganu laka Sapanga ila kuhobale kwaki kumpekia makili nukunhobale Sapanga henu anndumbalia Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>Jamanya ana sakaka Sapanga juwesa kuhenga gala gaandagila. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Ndi ndaba Sapanga anzetake kuba jwa amboni palongi jaki. <verse eid="ROM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>Paalonge, “Jatenda kunzetake kuba jwaamboni palongi jaki.” Ngasealonge anzetaki jubiya jwaamboni kajika jaki pena. <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>Lijambu le heli lutulongale natwepani kabee totujetakiwi na Sapanga totunhobale Sapanga joanhyoa Yesu Bambu witu kuhuma kwa bandu baawii. <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/>Yesu bumpia jukuwa ndaba ja mahakau gitu, jayoka ili kutuhenga twaamboni palongi jaka Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s">Kuba waamboni palongi jaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Henu, ndaba Sapanga jututei tubia twaamboni palongi jaki kupete kuhobale, henu tubii nulukwali na Sapanga kupete indela jaka Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>Ndaba jukuhobale kwitu, Yesu jutuletiki mu waamboni waka Sapanga mo tutama sajenu. Natwepani tutogule kukipuni kuhobale kotubi naku kutama pamu nu ulumbi waka Sapanga! <verse eid="ROM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>Ngahela pena, ila tutogule ndaba ja mang'aliku koni tumanya mang'aliku gutubola kuhinakali, <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>kuhinakali kungangamalisa mundu mwoju, nu kugangamaa mwoju kundete mundu kuhobale. <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>Nukuhobale ngasekutuhenga tusindwa, ndaba Sapanga jutupeki upali waki mu myoju jitu kupete indela jaka Loho wa Sapi jejutupeki.<verse eid="ROM 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Ndaba hata patwabiya twakona nga na makili, esahika kipindi, Kilisitu jwakuwa ndaba jitu twepani twana mahakau. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Sakaka, ngasekuwesikana mundu kuwa ndaba ja mundu jo jujetakeka palongi ja bandu ila kuwesikana mundu kulenga kuwa ndaba ja mundu jwaamboni. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Lakini Sapanga julangi kwitu jutenda kutupala, ndaba patwabia twakona tubi na mahakau, Kilisitu jwakuwa ndaba jitu twepani. <verse eid="ROM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Henu ndaba jututei tubia twaamboni palongi jaki kupete mwai waka Yesu Kilisitu, kulangi sakaka jwatukombula kuhuma mwi inyela yaka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Ndaba twabia twaabaja baka Sapanga lakini jutulenganaki tubia twaakosi baki kupete kuwa kwaka Mwana waki. Henu ngati hetubii twaakosi baka Sapanga sakaka kulangi he jwatuokuwa kupete womi waka mweni Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Nga haga pena ila tutogule kabee ndaba jagala gajutuhengi Sapanga kupete indela jaka Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu jojutujonganisi na Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu na Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>Kupete indela jaka mundu jumu mahakau gatenda kujingi punndema, nagombi gaatenda bandu akuwa. Henu kuwa kwaahiki bandu boka ndaba bandu bowa atei mahakau. <verse eid="ROM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Ndaba kabula jukuhika malagalaki gaka Musa mahakau gabii punndema, lakini mahakau ngase gabonakini bila kuba Malagalaki. <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Lakini toka pajwabii Adamu mbaka pajwahikiki Musa, kuwa kwaapatiki hata bandu banga kutenda mahakau ngati hejwatenda Adamu, mahakau guku nng'anambuka Sapanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Adamu jwabii lilenganu laka jola jojwihika. <verse eid="ROM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Lakini lihakau laka Adamu ngase lilengana na waamboni waka Sapanga. Ndaba ana mahakau gaka mundu jumu galeta kuwa kwa bandu boti, kulangi ana uamboni waka Sapanga gobii gwingi na nhupi jaki ja bwaka jejibii kwa bandu bingi, nayombi ihuma kwaka mundu jumu, mundu we hoju ndi Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>Nhupi yaka Sapanga ngaseilengana sekiipitila baada jukuhenga lihakau mundu jumu: Sapanga jwaatemula bundu kupete lihakau lejwatei mundu jumu, lakini bandu bingi pababiya ahengiki mahakau, Sapanga jaaletila nhupi jakuba jwaamboni palongi jaki. <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Sakaka, kupete lihakau laka mundu jumu, kuwa kwatenda kuhika ndaba jaka mundu jumu hoju, lakini kulangi sekipiti kupete sejutei mundu jumu hoju yaani ndi Yesu Kilisitu hekibi kikolongu ngani! Boka baajopa waamboni waka Sapanga wabwaka hogu na nhupi heji ahengwa kuba waamboni palongi jaka Sapanga, biitawala mu womi kupete indela jaka jumu hoju, yaani Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Henu ngati hekubi lihakau laka mundu jumu liletiki kutemuliwa kwa bandu boka ndi ahelahe kupete lijambu limu laamboni laka mundu jumu kwaka Sapanga laapeke boti waamboni na womi. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Na ngati hekubi kusindwa kunzowane Sapanga kwaka mundu jumu hekwaatenda bandu bingi abia na mahakau, ndi ahelahela kunzowane Sapanga kwaka mundu jumu hekwaatenda bandu bingi kuba baamboni palongi jaka Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Malagalaki gaka Musa gahika ili kuleta ujonzukeku wa mahakau, lakini mahakau hegajonzukika, waamboni waka Sapanga nagombi watenda kujonzukeka ngani. <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>Ngati mahakau hegalongosa nukuleta kuwa, ndi ahelahe waamboni wa bwaka waka Sapanga ulongusa kwi indela ja kwaahenga bandu abiya baamboni palongi jaki nu kulongosa abiya na womi wa masoba goti kupete indela jaka Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s">Kutama sukujongana ni kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Henu tupwaga boo? Boo, tuendalia lee kukuhenga mahakau ili waamboni waka Sapanga ujonzukikaje? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Ngahela! Twepani twe tuwii kupete mahakau tuwesa boo kuendalee kuhenga mahakao? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Au lee ngase mmanya twepani twaboa twe twabatiswa nukujongana na Yesu Kilisitu sukujongana na kuwa kwaki. <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/>Patwabatiswa twajongana pamu na jombi mu kuwa kwaki nukusikwa kwaki, ili ngati Kilisitu ejayoka kuhuma kwa bandu baawi kupete ulumbi wa Atati na twepani kabee tuwesa kuba na womi nyai.<verse eid="ROM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Ndaba ana twepani tujongini najombi kwa kuwa kwaki ngati jombi, ahelahela twiijongana najombi sukuyoka ngati hejwayoka jombi. <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>Tumanya umundu witu wa mwandi buubambalia pamu na Kilisitu, ili nhyega itu ya mahakau ialabika, ili tukotuka kuba twaatumwa ba mahakau kabee. <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>Ndaba mundu jokapi jojuwi julekakiwi, na ngasejulongoswa na mahakau. <verse eid="ROM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Henu ana tuwi pamu na Kilisitu, tuhobale twiitama kabee pamu na jombi. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Ndaba tumanya Kilisitu juyokiki kuhuma kwa bandu baawi najombi nga jukui kabee, ndaba kuwa nga kukubi na makili kabee kwaake. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>Henu, ndaba jwakuwa mala jimu pee ndaba ja mahakau ga bandu, mahakau ngasegunndoo jombe, nukutama kojutama jujongana na Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Ahelahela nanamu kupalika mulibona ntei kuwa kupete mahakau, nukutama pamu na Sapanga kupete na Kilisitu Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Henu, mwiijetake mahakau galongua nhyega hinu jejikuwa ili mwiijetake ndokule iliya ya nhyega. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Wala mwiipia hata pandu pamu pa nhyega ji ibia sindu sukutende mahakau. Ila mulipia kwaka Sapanga ngati bandu babayokiki kuhuma kukuwa kujingi mu womi. Lakini mpia ihungu yi yoti ihenga lihengu laka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Ndaba mahakau ngagundongoo mwanganya kabee, ndaba ngase nndongoswa na Malagalaki gaka Musa ila nndongoswa na waamboni waka Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumisi jojuhenga gaamboni palongi jaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Henu, tupwaga kike? Tutendaa mahakau ati ndaba ngasetubi pai ja malagalaki ila tulongoswa na waamboni waka Sapanga? Ngahela! <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Mmanya nde ana mulipiiki mwabe kuba mwaatumwa sukunzoane mundu najongi, sakaka mwanganya mkuba mwaatumwa baka mundu we hoju. Ana mwiikuba mwaatumwa ba mahakau mwisu waki kuwa, na ana mmbii mwaatumwa bukunzoane Sapanga mwisu waki junhenga mmbiya mwaamboni palongi jaki. <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Ata na mwabi mwaatumwa ba mahakau pamwandi, lakini henu nunsengu Sapanga nzetaki kwa mwoju wii woti usakaka gogubii mu mabole ganzopiki. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Mwakombuliwi kuhuma mu utumwa wa mahakau, nakuba mwa atumwa bukuhenga majambu gaamboni palongi jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>Nonge luga jakawaida ja bandu ndaba jukusindwa kumanya kwitu. Ndaba mwabe mulipia kutumaki upija nu ulia ndaba ju ubaja, ahelahela henu mulipia mwabeti kuba mwaatumwa bukutenda majambu gaamboni palongi jaka Sapanga ili nhuwesa kutama mu usapi.<verse eid="ROM 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Pamwabia mwa atumwa ba mahakau ngase mwawesiki kuhenga gajupala Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Mwapata sindu boo, saamboni pamwahenga hindu yemwibone hioni sajenu? Ndaba mwisu wa majambu haga goti ndi kuwa! <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Lakini henu mkombuliwi kuhumu ku utumwa wa mahakau na mmbi mwa atumwa baka Sapanga, sindu samboni se mpata sajenu ndi kutama maisa gu usapi gagaleta womi wa masoba goti. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Ndaba malepu ga mahakau ndi kuwa lakini nhupi jejupia Sapanga ndi womi wa masoba goti su kupete Yesu Kilisitu, Bambu witu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s">Malagalaki ga ndoa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Mwaalongu bangu henu manyiki nonge na bandu babagamanya malagalaki. Ndaba mmanyiki ana malagalaki gunndongoo mundu pajukuba mwomi. <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Tupwaga, mmbomba jobunzukwi jukuba pai ja Malagalaki pajutama nu nndomi waki pajukuba mwomi, lakini nndomi waki ana juwii, Malagalaki haga ngasegundongosa kabee mmbomba hoju. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Henu mmbomba hoju na jutama na mwanalomi jongi kipindi nndomi waki jubii mwomi, bankema nhgoni, lakini nndomi waki ana juwii, mmbomba hoju jukuba julekakiwi ngasejubii pai ja malagalaki kabee, ana jujukuliki na mwanalomi jongi ngajwiikubi nhgone. <verse eid="ROM 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Ahelahe mwaalongu bangu ngasemmbii kabee mu Malagalaki ndaba nnzongini na nhyega jaka Yesu Kilisitu, mana jaki Kilisitu pajakuwa na mwanganya mwakuwa pamu najombi. Henu mwanganya mmbii mwabandu baki, jombi Kilisitu jojuyokiki ili nhwesa kuntumaki sapi Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Ndaba patwabia tutama sukulongoswa na kutokule kuliya kwa nhyega kotubii naku, kutokule kokutukoluwa ndaba ja Malagalaki gaka Musa, kokukwe gahenga lihengu nkati ja nhyega jitu nukutulete kuwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Lakini henu tulekakiwi kuhuma muipungu ya Malagalaki, ndaba tuwi ndaba ji lijambu le lutuhenga twepani tubia twaatumwa. Henu tuwesa kuntumaki Sapanga sukupwata indela inyai ju ulongosi waka Loho jaki, wala nga ngati pamwandi patwabiya tulongoswa na maandiku ga Malagalaki.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagalaki na Mahakau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>Boo, nala tupwaga hetupwata Malagalaki tutenda mahakau? Ngahela! Lakini bila Malagalaki nepani nga nakamanyi mahakao. Ndaba nganaka manyi kutokule majambu gilyaa ndi sindu salia, ana Malagalaki egakabii ngase gapwagiki, “Wiitokule.” <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Sukutumi mihilu heji, mahakau gapata napwasi jukujumu kila aina jukutokulee kwalia kokubi nkati ja nhyega. Ndaba bila Malagalaki mahakau gakubape sindu sekiwii. <verse eid="ROM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Pamwandi nepani nabii namwomi kutali na malagalaki, lakini mihilu hejahika, mahakau gatenda kuyoka nanepani nabii ngati ndei kuwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>Henu Mihilu jejapala kuleta womi, kwangu nepani jiletiki kuwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/>Ndaba mahakau gapata napwasi kwi indela ji mihilu ajelaje nukungonga nepani nu kungoma.<verse eid="ROM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Henu, Malagalaki geni gabii pe gaga Sapi ni mihilu je heji jabii pe jeja Sapi, kabee jaamboni palongi jaka Sapanga na ja sapi. <verse eid="ROM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Boo, sesabi saamboni saleta kuwa kwangu nepane? Ngahela! Mahakau ndi gaganeti nepani kuwa. Lakini ili mahakau gabonikana mahakau ga sakaka, gapetila indela ja sindu sekikuba sa amboni ili kuleta kuwa kwangu. Henu mahakau kupete indela ji mihilu, gililangia sapi hegabii giliyaa ngamaa.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngondu nkati jaka mundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>Tumanya Malagalaki ndi loho, lakini nepani namundu jumu nndema, nepani anombisi mia ntumwa wa mahakau. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/>Ngase nikimanyi sehenga, ndaba sembala kuhenga ngase mbala kuhenga lakini sindu se nikisuki ndi se nihenga. <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Henu, ana nihenga sanga kukipala namwe, kulangi nyetake Malagalaki kuba ga amboni. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Lakini henu nga nepani jojuhenga sanga kukipala ila mahakau gagatama nkati jangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Manyiki ngasekibi samboni sokapi nkati jangu nepani, kulengana nu umundu wangu. Ndaba mbala kutenda lijambu lelibii laamboni, lakini ngase nhwesa kuhenga. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>Ndaba lijambu laamboni lenilipala ngase nilihenga, ila lijambu la liyaa langa kupala kulihenga ndi lenilihenga. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Henu ana nihenga lijambu langa kulipala namweti, henu kulangi nga namwete jojuhenga haga ila ga mahakau gagatama nkati jangu ndi gagahenga.<verse eid="ROM 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Henu manyiki Malagalaki gahenga lihengu nkati jangu: Pambala kuhenga lijambu laamboni, nilibona nihaguu kuhenga lijambu li liyaa. <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Ndaba nkati ja mojuwangu nitogule Malagalaki gaka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>Lakini nagabona malagalaki gangi gagahenga lihengu mu nhyega jango, malagalaki gagapengana na Malagalaki gagajetakewa na malangu gangu. Henu ganhenga mia nuntumwa wa malagalaki ga mahakau gagahenga lihengu mu nhyega jango. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Musinikiboni namundu nhagu nepani! Nya jojwingombula nepani kuhuma mu nhyega jejinongo nepani kuwa? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>Jusengulikaa Sapanga jojutenda hela kupete Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Hela ndi hemi, kwa malangu gangu ndumaki Malagalaki gaka Sapanga lakini kwa ndokule yangu ya nhyega jangu ndumaki malagalaki ga mahakau.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="s">Kulongoswa na Loho wa Sapi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Henu sajenu bandu baatama kupete Kilisitu Yesu ngase kubii kutemuliwa kwabu kabee. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Ndaba, malagalaki gaka Loho jojuleta womi jojubii nkati jaka Yesu Kilisitu ganhokwi kuhuma ku malagalaki ga mahakau na kuwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Sapanga juhengi lihengu legasindwa kuhenga Malagalaki, ndaba jukukosa makili kwa nhyega. Sapanga antumia Mwana waki wakajika koni jubii na nhyega ngati hejibii nhyega jitu twepani twetubii na mahakau ili jugawesa mahakau nukupete nhyega jeheji jugakoma mahakau. <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>Sapanga jwatenda hela ili sekipalika mu Malagalaki kihengika bwisu nkati jitu twepani twetubi twabomi, nga kwa makili gaka mundu ila kwa makili ga Loho. <verse eid="ROM 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Ndaba bandu baatama sukulongoswa na ndokule iliya ya nhyega malangu gabu galongoswa na ndokule ilia ya nhyega. Lakini bandu baatama sukulongoswa na Loho jaka Sapanga ahenga mahengu gajupala Loho jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Ndaba kulongoswa na ndokule ilia ya nhyega kuleta kuwa lakini kulongoswa na Loho jaka Sapanga kuleta womi nu lukwali. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Ndaba baalongoswa na ndokule ilia ya nhyegaa akuba abaja baka Sapanga, ngase bagajetake Malagalaki gaka Sapanga wala ngaseawesa kugajetake. <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Bandu baajetake kulongoswa na nhyega ngase awesa kunhenga Sapanga jutogulia.<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Lakini mwanganya ngase ntama sukulongoswa na nhyega, ila nndongoswa na Loho, ana Loho jwaka Sapanga jutama nkati jii. Jokapi jwangakuba na Loho jaka Kilisitu hoju nga mundu jwaka Kilisituje. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Lakini ana Kilisitu jubii nkati jinu, Loho jaka Sapanga jumpeke womi ndaba nkuba nzetakiwi kuba mwaamboni palongi jaka Sapanga hata ngati nhyega yinu yiibia iwi ndaba ja mahakau. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/>Ana Loho jaka Sapanga jojunhyoa Yesu kuhuma kwa bandu baawi jutama nkati jinu, nala joanhyoa Yesu hoju jwaipekia womi nhyega jii jejikuba ja kuwa, jwiihenga hela kupete Loho jaki jojutama nkati jino.<verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Henu mwaalongu bangu, tubii ni lihengu lukuhenga, lakini nga lukulongoswa na ndokule iliya ya nhyega ngati heipala. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Ndaba ana ntama sukulongoswa na ndokule ilya ya nhyega sakaka mwiitenda kuwa. Lakini kupete Loho ana mugakoma mahengu gii gilyaa nala mwiitenda kutama. <verse eid="ROM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Boti baalongoswa na Loho jaka Sapanga ndi bana baka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/>Ndaba ngasemwajopiki Loho jojwanhenga mwanganya kuba mwaatumwa kabee nukunzege kiholu, ila munzopiki Loho jojunhenga mwanganya kuba mwabana baka Sapanga, na kwa Loho hoju, twepwani tunkema Sapanga, yani “Aba!” Mana jaki, “Atati” <verse eid="ROM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Najombi Loho mweni julangi mu loho yitu kupwaga twepani twabana baka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>Henu ndaba twepani twabana baka Sapanga, twiijopa mbengale yoka yejwaabeki Sapanga bandu baki, twiilisa ulisi hogu pamu na Kilisitu, ndaba ana tung'aliki pamu na Kilisitu ahelahe twiilumbalika kabee pamu na jombi.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulumbi goguhika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>Mang'aliku gagabonikana sajenu kwangu nee mona nga sindo ana nagalenganisi nu ulumbi gogwiibonikana kwiitu. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Hindu yomi yoka yunndendale Sapanga kwa hamu ngolongu jwaalangia bana baki. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/>Ndaba hindu yomi yoka biing'anambwi kuba yanga na mana, nga sukupala yeni ila biibombiki hela sukupala Sapanga mweni. Ila kuhobale kubii, <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>ndaba ihumbi hei nayombi yiigombuliwa kuhuma mu utumwa wo uhalabanika, nukujingi ukulekakewa mu ulumbi wa bana baka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Ndaba tumanya mbaka sajenu, ihumbi yoka ilela sukubobo su ubini ngati ulipyanda lukubeleka mwana. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/>Nga ihumbi hei pena yeyibobula ila hata twepani twetubi tayali na Loho jaka Sapanga, jojubii jukutumbulii mu nhupi yejwatupekia Sapanga, natwe twiitenda kubobo nkati jitu koni tulendale kujetakewa na Sapanga kuba twabana baki yani kugombolewa umundu witu. <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Ndaba kupete kuhobale hoku twepani tukombuliwi. Lakini kuhobale ngasekubi na mana ana tukibona setukihobale. Ndaba nya jojuhobale sindu sejukibona? <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Ana tukihobale sindu sanga kukibona nala tukilendalee sukuhinakali.<verse eid="ROM 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Helahe kabee najombi Loho jutujangati muku sindwa kwitu. Ndaba ngasetumanya hetupalika kuloba lakini Loho mweni jutulobe kwaka Sapanga kwikilelu sukubobo. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Najombi Sapanga jojubona mbaka nkati ja myoju ja bandu, jumanya mawasu ga Loho hoju, ndaba Loho hoju jwaalobe bandu baka Sapanga kulengana nu upali waka Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>Tumanya mu majambu goti gajuhenga Sapanga juhenga kwa bandu boti babumpala, yaani bajaakemiki kulengana na sejaakemi. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Ndaba Sapanga jwaamanyiki bandu baki toka pu utumbuli na jwaagula ili awanangana na mwana waki, ili mwana jubia ju utumbuli mu kilongu sa bandu bingi. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Ndienu bandu bajatumbuli kwaagu Sapanga ndi bajwaakemiki, na bajwaakemiki haba ndi bajwaahengiki kuba baamboni palongi jaki na bajwaahengiki kuba baamboni palongi jaki haba ndi bajwaapeki ulumbi waki.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Upali waka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Henu kupete haga tupwaga kii ngane? Ana Sapanga jubii upandi witu nya jojwibia jukutupenga? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>Sapanga ngaseambonila ikia hata Mwana waki wakajika ila ampia ndaba jitu twepani twaboka. Jwiisindwa boo, kutupeke sindu sengi sokapi bwaka ana tubi pamu najombe? <verse eid="ROM 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Nyaa jojiwesa kwaatemu bandu baahaguliwi na Sapanga? Sapanga mweni ndi jojutulekake mahakau. <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Henu nya jojwaatemula? Ngasejubii. Ndaba Yesu Kilisitu ndi jojuwii kabee jwayoka kuhuma kwa bandu baawii na jutama upandi wa malele waka Sapanga. Jombi ndi jojututulobe! <verse eid="ROM 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Nya jojuwesa kututenga nu upali waka Kilisitu? Boo shida lena au tabu au mang'aliku au inzala au kukosa ingobo atali au kuwa? <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>Ngati maandiku gaka Sapanga hegapwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">“Ndaba jaku tukuba mu mang'aliku ga kuwa kila lisoba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">atubeka ngati makondoo gu kusinzwa.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Ngahela, lakini mu majambu goti haga tupatiki kuwesa kukolongu sukutujangati jombi jojutupala. <verse eid="ROM 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Ndaba manya sakaka nga sindu sengi sekiwesa kututenga twepani nu upali waka Sapanga wala kuwa wala womi wala atumi bu kunani wala ilombu au makili gangi gukunani kwaka Sapanga wala gagapitii sajenu wala gagiipitila mweni katai wala aka kilongosi, <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>wala gagabii kunani wala gagabii pai. Wala ngasekibii kiumbi sokapi sekiwesa kututenga nu upali waka Sapanga woubii kupete Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s">Sapanga na bandu baki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>Mbwaga sakaka nepani namundu waka Yesu Kilisitu, wala ngase nonge isole na moju wangu gunangi koni nongoswa na Loho jaka Sapanga sakaka ngase nonge isoli. <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>Pamwaga hela niangajika ngamaa mumoju jangu nu ubini nkolongu wanga kukotoka mu moju jango. <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>Nndokule hata kupata yaambamba nukubekwa kutali na Kilisitu ndaba ja bandu ajangu ba ndema jangu baabi likabila limu na nepani. <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/>Haba ndi bandu buku Isilaheli bajwaagwi Sapanga kuba bana baki, jwaapekia ulumbi waki, jwatenda nabu malaganu, jwaapekia Malagalaki gaki, jwaabola namuna jukugungamali na kwaapeke malagi gaki. <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>Haba ndi asoko baka aka hoku akolongu, babube Kilisitu jwahika koni jubii na nhyega kupete kwabu. Jombi ndi Sapanga jojulongoo majambu goti, juku lumbaliwa yaka petapeta. Amina.<verse eid="ROM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Ngase mbwaga lilagi laka Sapanga litei kusindwa. Ndaba nga kila jojuhuma ku Izilaeli ndi bandu baka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/>Wala nga kibeleku soka saka Ibulahimu ndi bana baki ba sakaka. Ila ngati hegapwaga Maandiku gaka Sapanga, “Kupete Isaka ndi nakupekia kibeleku bandu bikibeleku saku” <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Ndi kupwaga, nga babana baabelikwi kwa nhyega ndi bana baka Sapanga ila bana bahumi ku lilaganu laka Sapanga ndi bana baka Ibulahimu. <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/>Ndaba lilaganu le ndi lende, “Niikelabukia kabee kipindi ngati senze na Sala jwiipapa mwana mwanalomi.”<verse eid="ROM 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Kabee nga hagapee, ila kabee Lebeka najombi jwiipata bana bamapaa kwa atati jumu yaani ahoku bitu a Isaka. <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11"/>Ndaba kabula mapaa bala ngaseasaliwi wala ngaseatei lijambu lamboni au lilyaa ili kupala kwaka Sapanga kuwesa kuba nganganganga, <verse eid="ROM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12"/>Sapanga ampwagila Lebeka mwana jojutumbuli jola jwantumakia mwana jwamwisu. Henu hejuhagu Sapanga kutegamee hejukema mweni, na ngase kutegame mahengu gaka mundu. <verse eid="ROM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/>Ngati Maandiku gaka Sapanga hegapwaga, “Numpala Yakobu lakini nunsukia Esau.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>Henu tupwaga bole? Sapanga jukosi lee kuhenga gajupala kuhenga? Ngahela! <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/>Ndaba Sapanga ampwagila Musa, “Nanzangatia mundu jokapi jombala kunzangati, nammbonila ikia mundu jokapi jonumpai.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Henu majambu goka gahobale ikia yaka Sapanga na nga kukasana kwaka mundu au kupala kwaka mundu. <verse eid="ROM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/>Ndaba maandiku gaka Sapanga gapwaga ana kwaka Falao, “Nukuhagwi gubia bambu nkolongu uku Misili ili kupete indela jaku, makili gangu gamanyikana punndema pani ni liina langu limanyikana pu nndema poti.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Henu, Sapanga antende ikia joampala kuntende ikia na ana jupai kuntenda mundu jubia niing'omu, jutenda ahelahela.<verse eid="ROM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inyela ni ikia yaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Nhwesa kunaluki, “Ana kubihela enu ndaba jaki Sapanga jwaataki bandu? Ndaba nya jojuwesa kupengana na gajupala jombi?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/>Lakini, wamundu we ndi wanya mbaka gulenga kusindana na Sapanga? Boo kibega kiwesa kunndaluki jojukibombiki, “Ndaba jaki gumombiki anana.” <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>Jojubomba ibega juwesa kutumi utopi ngati hejupala nu kubomba ibega ibeli kupete utopi agolago, simu kutumalia majambu gini isima na sengi kutumala majambu gakawaida.<verse eid="ROM 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Hela ndi hekubii kwaka Sapanga. Jwapala kulangi inyela yaki nu kutumanyisa makili gaki. Henu jwaainakali ngamaa bandu babapalika kutemuliwa kwi inyela yaki, haba ndi baapalika kuwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>Jwapala kabee kulangi ulumbi waki wingi gojutujakanakya twepani twetupalika kupata ikia yaki, twepani batwabi jutuandi kujopa ulumbi waki. <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>Ndaba twepani ndi bandu bajwaakemiki haba, nga kuhuma kati ja Ayaudi pena ila kabee kuhuma kwa bandu bandema yaka. <verse eid="ROM 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/>Ndaba ndi hejupwaga mukitabu saka Hosea jojwabi mlota waki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">“Bandu bababi, nga bandu bango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">henu naakema, ‘Bandu bangu,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">na bandu bababia ngase naapai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">‘Niitenda kwaapala’<verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>Na pabaapwagila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">‘Mwanganya nga mwabandu bango’ hapa baakema, ‘Bana baka Sapanga jojubii mwomi.’ ” <verse eid="ROM 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>Isaya jojwabii mlota waka Sapanga jwaalakalia Aizilaeli kwa sauti ngolongu kupwaga, “Hata ana bandu buku Aizilaeli abii bingi ngati nsangi uku mbwani, Aizilaeli asokopi pee babii okuliwa, <verse eid="ROM 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/>ndaba Bambu, jwiihenga kutemu kwaki kwoti pu nndema pani nyatanyata.” <verse eid="ROM 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/>Ngati Isaya Mlota waka Sapanga hejwalonguli kupwaga, “Bambu jwana makili ana ngajwaka tulekake twabana bangi buku Isilaeli, twakabia tubii ngati twa bandu buku Sodoma, twakabia tubii ngati bandu buku Gomola.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli jwaalobe bandu banga Ayaudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Henu tupwaga kike? Bandu banga Ayaudi babube ngase batapwiti kuba baamboni palongi jaka Sapanga baatei kuba baamboni palongi jaka Sapanga kupete kuhobale, <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>lakini bandu buku Izilaeli babataputa malagalaki jaka Musa gakaahenga bombi kuba baamboni palongi jaka Sapanga, ngase bapatiki kuba baamboni palongi jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Ndaba jaki ngase babonikini baamboni palongi jaka Sapanga? Ndaba bahobalia mahengu gabu badala jukunhobale Sapanga. “Bilikobandua pililibu lukujikobando,” <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>ngati hegapwaga mahandiku gaka Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">“Linga, niibeka ku Sayuni lilibu lukukobando,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">Lilibu lelaahenga bandu ahabuka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">lakini jojuhobale nga bampoi lihamo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">Lakini jojwii hobalia ngajuhobe.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Mwaalongu bangu, sindu se ndokule mmwoju wangu woti na se nundoba Sapanga ndaba ja bandu buku Isilaeli aokuliwaje. <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Ndaba nhwesa kulonge hotuhotu kupwaga bombi antaputa Sapanga ngamaa lakini kuntaputa kwehoku ngase kuhumi mu umanyi wa sakaka. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Ndaba ngase bamanyiki namuna Sapanga he jwaahenga bandu kuba baamboni palangi jaki na alengiki kutumbuli indela jabu beni na ngase bijijetaki indela jaka Sapanga heji ja kwaahenga abia Baamboni palongi jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Ndaba kupete kuhika Kilisitu Malagalaki gahiki pamwisu jaki, ili bandu boka ba ahobale ahengika kuba baamboni palongi jaka Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ukombosi kwa bandu boti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>Ndaba ja kuba waamboni palongi jaka Sapanga kupete kugajetake Malagalaki, Musa jwaandiki ana, “Mundu jokapi jojutenda gagapala Malagalaki jwiitama kupete Malagalaki haga.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>Lakini kupete kuba waamboni kupete kuhobale, apwaga ana, “Walilaluki mmoju waku, ‘Nya jojwiikwela kunani kwaka Sapanga?’ ” Ili kunndeta Kilisitu pai, <verse eid="ROM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>wala wiipwaga, “Nya jojwiiuluka mbaka ku libomba koatama bandu baawi?” Ili kunndeta Kilisitu kuhuma koatama bandu baawii. <verse eid="ROM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Uamboni palongi jaka Sapanga kwi indela jukuhobale gupwaga ana, “Malobi gaka Sapanga gabi pambipi na weapa, gabii pundomu jaku nu kumwoju jaku.” Malobi haga ndi malobi gukuhobale gatwaalandi bandu. <verse eid="ROM 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>Ana ujetaki kupete nndomu waku kupwaga Yesu ndi Bambu nuku hobale mu moju jaku kupwaga Sapanga anhyoa Yesu kuhuma kwa bandu baawi, wiitenda kuokoka. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Ndaba mundu juhobale kwa mwoju nuku jetakewa kuba jwaamboni palongi jaka Sapanga, kabee kupete nndomu mundu jutenda kujetake kuhobale sukulonge, ndi jwiitenda kuokoka. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/>Maandiku gaka Sapanga gapwaga, “Kila joanhobale nga ampoi lihamo.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/>Lijambu heli la bandu boha, ndaba ngasekubi na tofauti kati ja Ayaudi na bandu banga Ayaudi, kwa ndaba Bambu hoju ndi Bambu wa bandu boha na jwaajopa bandu boti ba bunndoba. <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>Ndaba Maandiku gaka Sapanga gapwaga, “Kila mundu jojwiiloba kupetee lihina laka Bambu jwiitenda kuokolewa.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Henu, banndoba boo, mundu jojuwe ngase bunhobalela? Kabee banhobalia boo ana ngaseajowani malobi gake? Na biijowa boo malobi gaki ana ngasejubii mundu jojwaalandile? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/>Na bandu biilandila boo malobi gaki ana ngase baatumike? Ngati hegapwaga maandiku gaka Sapanga, “Linga hekunyamba he aika bandu ba alandii Lijambu la Amboni laka Sapanga!” <verse eid="ROM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/>Lakini nga boti babilijopiki Lijambu la Amboni laka Sapanga ndaba hata Isaya mlota waka Sapanga jwapwagiki, “Bambu nya jojwahobali malobi gito?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Henu kuhobale kuhika kuhuma he gujowane malobi gaka Sapanga, na malobi gehaga gahika kupete kulandiwa malobi gaka Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>Lakini naluki, boo, bombi lee ngase bajogwine malobi gaka Sapanga haga? Helo, bajogwine, ngati malobi gaka Sapanga he gapwaga, “Sauti jabu jieni pu nndema poti, na malobi gabu gahikiki mbaka pamwisu gu punndema.” <verse eid="ROM 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>Nanepani naluki kabee, boo, bandu buku Izilaeli ngase bamanyiki lena? Sapanga jwapwagiki kupete Musa we jupwaga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">“Nanhenga mmbia na wipu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">kupete bandu banga Ayaudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">nanhenga mmbia ni inyela kwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">kupete bandu ang'ang'a.” <verse eid="ROM 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>Kabee Isaya mlota waka Sapanga jwapwaga hotuhotu malobi haga, “Sapanga jupwagiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">‘Bandu banga kundaputa ambatiki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">nililangii kwa bandu banga kulaluki majambu gangu.’ ” <verse eid="ROM 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>“Lakini kwaka bandu buku Izilaeli mbwaga ana, ‘Muhi pipi naanyoshi maboku gangu bandu baang'alambuka na banga kujetaka.’ ”<verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s">Ikia yaka Sapanga kwa bandu baka Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>Henu naluki, boo, Sapanga lee jwaakaniki bana bake? Ngahela! Nenamwe Nunhisilaeli, kibeleku saka Ibulahimu, lukolu lwaka Benyamini. <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Sapanga ngase jwaakaniki bandu baki bajwaagwi toka mwandi. Nkomboka hegapwaga Maandiku gaka Sapanga kunndongale Elia paanndalamakia Sapanga kuhusu Izilaeli, <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/>“Bambu, baakomiki alota baku nu kubombo mesa jukupiiki litambiku jaku. Nhigali pe nepani kajika jangu, nabombi apala kungoma!” <verse eid="ROM 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Boo, Sapanga jwajibwa kii? Ampwagila, “Nilibeki bandu elupu saba banga kunngungamali kisapanga jwiisoli Baali.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>Henu ndi hekubii kipindi seenzeno, abii bandu bangi kidogu baaigali babube Sapanga jwaagwi ndaba ja waamboni waki. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>Kuhagu kwaki kuhika kulengana na waamboni waki, na nga ndaba ja mahengu gabu. Ndaba, ana kuhagu kwaki kwakahika kulengana na mahengu ga bandu, waamboni waki nga wakabii waamboni wa sakaka.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Henu boo? Bandu buku Izilaeli ngase bikipatiki sebabia bikitaputa, lakini boka bababia baahagwi bikipatiki. Bangi mioju jabu jabia ni ing'omu, <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/>ngati hegapwaga Maandiku gaka Sapanga, “Sapanga jwaatei mioju jabu kuba ni ing'omu, na mbaka lelenu ngase awesa kubona kwa miu gabu wala kujogwana kwa makutu gabu.” <verse eid="ROM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>Najombi Daudi jupwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">“Tipati jabu jabia ntegu gwa kwaakamuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">ahabuka nukupata azabu.<verse eid="ROM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>Mihu gabu gabia bagajegi lwii ili biiwesa kulinga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">Migongu jabu jiipendika kwa tabu masoba goti!”<verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Henu naluki kabee, boo, Ayaudi lee alikobandwi ili ahabuka nukuhoba ngane? Ngahela! Lakini kulengana nukukose kwabu Ayaudi, ukombosi waajendi bandu bandema yoti, ili Ayaudi abona wipu. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>Likosa la Ayaudi liletiki mbengee ingipi pu nndema, ni ing'omu yabu mu loho iletiki mbengee ingi kwa bandu bandema yoti. Lakini henu kulangi, kwibia na mbengelelu ngolongu ngamaa kwa Ayaudi haba boti he biijingiswa na bombi mu waamboni waka Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uokovu wa bandu ba ndema yoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>Henu, numpwagi mwa bandu banga Ayaudi. Ndaba nepani nuntumi kwa bandu bandema yoka, henu nikipuni lihengu lango, <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>ili kwaa pangi, niiwesa kwaahenga Ayaudi bummbonila wipu, ili nhwesa kwaagombo bangi babu. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Ndaba ana kukanaliwa kwabu Ayaudi kwaahenga bandu bapandema pani ajetakiwa na Sapanga, kwibia boo he biijetakiwa na Sapanga? Bandu baakuiki mu loho biitenda kuyoka.<verse eid="ROM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Ana kipandi sakwanza silibumunda bikipia kwaka Sapanga, nilibumundu loka ilkuba bilipiiki kwaka sapanga, nimikega junkongu ana jibi jaasapi na mambandi gaki gakuba gaasapi. <verse eid="ROM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Mambandi gangi gi Mizeituni kukijongu batei kuseku, na paasekwii jepala balombika limbandi li mizeituni lukukinyoi. Henu mwabandu banga Ayaudi nndengana ni limbandi heli lu kukinyoi, na henu nzongana kula posu pamu na mambandi gangi kuhuma kunkongu u mizeituni gu kukijongu. <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>Henu mwaalongama Aizilaeli baasekuliwi ngati mambandi! Nhwesa boo, mwa bandu ba ndema yengi kukipuna, nkombuka nga mwanganya mwe muipeke mikega posu ila mikega ndi jejumpeke mwanganya posu.<verse eid="ROM 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Lakini wiipwaga, “Mambandi basekula ili nepani anombika panani jaki.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Sakaka! Bagasekula ndaba jukusindwa kuhobale, ila weapa gujemiki ndaba gutei kuhobale. Lakini wakipuna ila utama mihu. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Ndaba ana Sapanga ngase jwaabonila ikia Ayaudi baabii ngati mambandi ga mwandi, gukita lee jwaguleka weapa jo bugulombiki pena? <verse eid="ROM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Linga henu Sapanga hejubii jwaamboni na hejubi nkali. Jombi jubii nkali kwa bandu baakotwiki kunzetake, na kabee jubii jwaamboni kwabandu baaendale kuba mu waamboni waki ana ngahela naweapa bakutenda kuguseku. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Nabombi Ayaudi ana akotwiki kusindwa kuhobale kwabu, baalombika kabee pandu pa pababii mwandi. Ndaba Sapanga jubii nu uwesu wa kwaalombika kabee. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Mwabandu banga Ayaudi, nndengana na mambandi gi mizeituni gukukinyoi lakini bunsekula hoku, nuku nndombeka mu mizeituni jukupanda pandu papabii nga pino. Lakini Ayaudi alengana ni mizeituni jukupanda, kwikuba nga lihengu likolongu kwabu kwaalombeka kabee mu nkongu gogwabia gwabu.<verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kugombolewa kwa bandu buku Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Mwaalongu bangu mbala mmanya usakaka gongo goguhihiki ili mwaalibona mmbi na malangu ngamaa. Ing'omu ya Ayaudi yabii ya muda nzepi pena, mbaka bandu bingi ba ndema yengi pabiikuba bunng'anambuki Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/>Hapandi likabila loka luku Izilaeli palitenda kugombolewa, ngati hegapwaga Maandiku gaka Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">“Nkombosi jwiihika kuhuma ku Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">jwauboa ubaja wa bana baka Yakobu.”<verse eid="ROM 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>“Lende ndi lilaganu le niihenga nabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">pa naalekakia mahakau gabu.” <verse eid="ROM 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Ndaba bilikana Lijambu la Amboni, Ayaudi enu abii abaja baka Sapanga, lakini ndaba jukunzangati mwanga mwabandu banga Ayaudi. Lakini ndaba ahaguliwi, henu bakona akosi baka Sapanga ndaba jaka ahuko babu. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Ndaba Sapanga ngase jung'anambu sejupangiki kupete bandu bajwaakemiki nakwaapengee. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Pamwandi mwanganya mwabii mwaabaja baka Sapanga, lakini henu mpatiki waamboni waki kupete kusindwa kujetake kwa Ayaudi. <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>Ndi haelahela kupete hikia ye jumpeki mwanganya, Ayaudi bunkose Sapanga ili nabombi henu ajopa waamboni waka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Ndaba Sapanga jwaahengiki bandu boti banzetake ili juwesa kwaabone ikia bandu boti.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kunndumbali Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>Mali gingi gaka Sapanga na malangu gaki nu umanyi waki nkolongu ngamaa! Nya jojuwesa kulandi kutemu kwaki? Nya jojuwesa kumanya indela yaki? <verse eid="ROM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/>Ngati maandiku gaka Sapanga hegapwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">“Nya jojumanya mawasu gaka Bambu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">Nya jojuwesa kumpwagi sukuhenga?<verse eid="ROM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>Nya joampeki Sapanga sindu sokapi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:35">ili jwiilepaje?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>Ndaba kila sindu kihuma kwaki, yoka ibii kupete uwesu waki na kwa ndaba jaki. Ulumbi ubia kwaki jombi yaka petapeta! Amina.<verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="s">Maisha guku ntumaki Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Henu mwaalongu bangu, ndaba jiikia yingi yaka Sapanga kwiitu, nunndoba kwa mwoju wa woti, mumpikya Sapanga nhyega jinu ngati matambiku gaga bii gomi, ga sapi na ga gunndengane Sapanga. Heji ndii ndela jinu ja sapi ja sakaka juku nngungamali Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Mwiipwata mitindu jupunndema pani, ila Sapanga juhenga mang'anambuku nkati jinu sukung'anambu mawasu ginu ili nhwesa kuumanya sejupala Sapanga, hapa ndi pamwiiwesa kugumanya upali waka Sapanga; hegubi wasapi na hejupala mwanganya mbia na litosane.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>Kupete waamboni gojumbeki Sapanga, numpwagi mwanganya mwaboka, mwalibona mwanganya ndi sindu kikolongu ngani kupeta hempalika kuholale. Mawasu ginu gabia ngati hekupalika kulengana ni kipemu suku hobale se ampeki Sapanga kila jumu wii. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>Ndaba nhyega jibii ni hiungu yiingipi kila kihungu kibi na lihengu laki. <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>Ahelahela na twepani twetubi twabingi, tubi nhyega jimu kupete Kilisitu, na twepani tujonganiswi pamu ngati iungu ndalindali ya hyega. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>Henu tubii na nhupi ndalindali kila mundu kulengana na waamboni waka Sapanga gojutupeki. Jojubii na nhupi ju ulota ukupwaga lilobi laka Sapanga jutumia kulengana na hejuhobale. <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>Jojubii na nhupi ju utumisi jutumika. Jojubi na nhupi jukubola na jubola. <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>Jojubii na nhupi ja kwaapolesa bandu mioju juhenga helahela. Jojubii na nhupi ya kwaabaguli bangi hindu yaki jwaabagulia sukutogule. Kilongosi julongusa sapi, na jojuhenga majambu gi ikia na juhenga ahelahela kwa mwoju gu upali.<verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Upali winu gubia nga gukukopakela. Nsukila lijambu lokapi lilia, mpwata lijambu lelibi laamboni. <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>Mpalana ngani mwabeni na mwabeni, kila mundu anhwasalia hoti nzaki sukuntende hisima. <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>Nkasana kuhenga lihengu mwikuba nikitondu ila muntumakia Bambu kwa moju wi woti. <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>Kuhobale kwinu kubia kukutogule muda woti, henkuba na shida nhinakalia, nukunndoba Sapanga masoba woka. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>Mwabagila bandu baka Sapanga mahitaji gabu, mwaajopa hageni kunyumba su upali.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>Mwaapengila boka babunng'alisa, mpengila wala mwaatende yaambamba. <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>Ntogulia pamu na baatogule, nndela pamu na bandu baalela. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>Ntama sulukwali. Mwiipala majambu makolongu ila mmbia tayali kuhenga majambu hata masoku. Mwalibona mmbi na malangu ngamaa.<verse eid="ROM 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>Mwilepa ubaja su ubaja. Ntenda majambu gabagabona bandu boka kuba gaamboni. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Ana kuwesakini, upandi winu ntama su lukwali na bandu boka. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/>Alongu bangu, mwiilepa ubaja, ila mundekila Sapanga lijambu heli, ndaba Maandiku gaka Sapanga gapwaga, “Kulepa ubaja ndi lihengu lango, nepani niitenda kulepesa, jupwaga Bambu.” <verse eid="ROM 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/>Badala jukuhenga hela, “Mmbaja waku ana jubii ni inzala, mpekia posu, ana jubi na nywita mpekia sakunywa. Ndaba sukuhenga hela wantenda jubia ni iyoni ikolongu ngati mundu jobumbeki makalakala gamotu.” <verse eid="ROM 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Wiijetake uliyaa ukuwesa weapa ila uguwesa ulia kupete kuhenga majambu gaamboni.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s">Kulibeka pai ju ulongosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Kila mundu jupalika kujowane nukuhenga seapwaga akakilongosi ba ndema, ndaba nga mundu jojuwesa kulongosa ana ngase juhuma kwaka Sapanga, Sapanga kajika jaki ndi jojwaapeke bandu uwesu ukulongosa. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Jojupenga sealagalaki aka kilongosi jupenga malagalaki gaka Sapanga, na baahenga hela bililete beni kutemuliwa. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Ndaba aka kilongosi ngase aleta kiholo kwa bandu baahenga gaamboni, ila aleta kiholu kwa bandu baahenga giliya. Boo, upala lee kukotoka kunzogopa kilongose? Nala henga gaasapi najombi jwiitenda kukulumbali, <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>ndaba jombi ntumisi waka Sapanga jojuhenga lihengu ndaba ja waamboni winu. Lakini ana nhenga gilia, munnzogupaje ndaba sakaka jubii nu uwesu gukumpeke azabu. Kilongosi hoju julangi inyela yaka Sapanga kwa bandu baahenga majambu gilia. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Henu kila mundu lasima kuhenga seapwaga aka kilongosi bandema, nga ndaba jukujogopa pee azabu jaka Sapanga, ila mojuwi gumanyaa sempala kuhenga.<verse eid="ROM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Ndaba ja hela mwanganya nndepa kodi, ndaba akakilongosi haba atumisi baka Sapanga ahenga lihengu heli sukuntumaki Sapanga na masoba goti bilipia ndaba ji lihengu heli. <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/>Mumpekia kila mundu sebunndaja ana ushulu ndepa ushulu, ana kodi nndepa kodi, jojupalika kuntende isima muntendila isima.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kupalana kwaka mundu jumu na jongi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Mwiikuba na madeni kwaka mundu jokapi, ila pe lideni lukupalana. Ndaba joampala wapambipi waki jutimisi Malagalaki. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>Ndaba miilu jipwaga, “Wiitenda ugoni na wiikoma na wiijiba na wiitokule,” na yengi yoka, ibii mu muhilu gumu gongo, “Umpala wapambipi waku ngati heulipala wamwete.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Joampala wapambipi waki ngase anhenge lihaa. Nala kuhenga upali ndi kuhenga Malagalaki goti.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Nanamu nhenga hela, koni muumanya muda gotubi nagu. Lisaa lukujumuka mulugonu lihikiki, ndaba henu kuokolewa kwitu kuhegali ngamaa kupeta patwabia tutumbuli kuhobale. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Ikilu jitenda kujomoka na lioba mutu kuhegale kuhika. Henu tulekala kutali majambu goka ga lwii, tuwata hindu yukukomane ngondu yu unang'anu. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>Na tutama kwi isima ngati hekupalika kipindi sa liobamutu, tukotuka ulapi nu ulepi, usapu nu kupala ugoni, kukomana na wiipu. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Lakini nzongana na Bambu Yesu Kilisitu, kabee mwiihenge lihengu lukutokulee kwa nhyega yii yeihumi mu mahakau.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s">Wantemu nkosi waku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Munzopa kunyumba jii mundu jojubii nukuhobale kusoku, lakini mwiibisana naku kupete mawasu gaki mweni. <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Bandu ngase alengana. Jongi kuhobale kwaki kunndeke jukula kila sindu, lakini jongi jojubii kuhobale kwaki kusoku, jukulape likolu la manyai. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Mundu jojukula kila sindu jukotuka kunndongama mundu jwanga kula kila sindu, najombi jojukula pe likolu la manyoi jukotuka kunndongama jojukula kila sindu, ndaba Sapanga jutei kunnzetake. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Weapa wanya mbaka ulenga kuntemu ntumisi wa mundu jongi? Ana jujemiki sapi mu mahengu gaki au ana juabwiki jwiimanya bambu waki, hena jwiijema nganganganga, ndaba Bambu Yesu juwesa kunzemeka.<verse eid="ROM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Mundu juwesa kuwasali lisoba limu kuba likolongu ngani kupeta lengi, mundu jongi juwesa kuwasali masoba goti gatenda kulengana. Kila jumu jupwata malangu gaki. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Jojulibalangi lisoba limu kuba lisoba likolongu kupeta lengi, juhenga hela ndaba juku nndumbali Sapanga. Mundu jojukana kula posu yengi juhengahela ndaba jukunndumbali Bambu ndaba ansengu Sapanga ndaba ja posu jeampeki. Ahelahela jojukotoka kula posu jengi juhenga hela ndaba juku nndumbali Bambu, najombi ansengu Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Ndaba nga mundu jokapi kati jitu jojutama punndema pani ndaba jaki mweni, wala nga jojukuwa ndaba jaki mweni pee. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Ndaba ana tutama ndaba jaka Bambu, na ana tuwi tukuwa ndaba jaka Bambu. Henu ana tuendale kutama au anna tuwi, twepani twabandu baka Bambu. <verse eid="ROM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Ndaba Kilisitu jwawii, nukuyoka ili juwesakuba Bambu wa bandu baabi bomi na bandu baawii. <verse eid="ROM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/>Ndaba jakii henu weapa huntemu nndongu waku? Nawe, ndaba jaki henu hundongama nzako? Ndaba twepani twaboa twiijema palongi jikiteu sukutemuli saka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>Ndaba maandiku gaka Sapanga gapwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">“Nepani Sapanga napa kye kololo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">kila mundu jwiimbegila magoti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">na kila mundu jwiijetakia kupwaga nepani na Sapanga.” <verse eid="ROM 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Henu, kila jumu witu jwiipia majambu gaki gajuhengiki palongi jaka Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wankosesa nndongu waku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Henu tukotuka kutemuana, badala jaki mundu jwikuba kikobandoo sukunhabu mundu jongi au kuntenda juhabukya mu mahakau. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Kupete kujongana na Bambu Yesu, minu uwakika kupwaga ngakuba posu jokapi mbija palongi jaka Sapanga toka kojuumi. Lakini mundu na juwasali posu jimu mbija, nala kwaki jombi jiikuba mbija. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Ana unhumisa nzaku ndaba ja posu jeukula, nala ngase guhenga ngati upali hegupala. Wiileka posu jegukula jibia indela jukunhoa nndongu waku jojuwe Kilisitu jwakuwa ndaba jaki. <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Mwiijetake sindu semukibona saamboni bandu bikilongama. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Ndaba Ukolongu waka Sapanga ngase guhusiana na kula na kunywa, ila kuhenga gajupala Sapanga na kuba nu lukwali nu kutogule kupete Loho jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Joantumaki Kilisitu ngati hela anndengane Sapanga nu kujetakewa na bandu boti.<verse eid="ROM 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Henu ana hela tuhenga muda woti majambu gagaleta lukwali na ga gutujangati kugangamalisana mioju katika kuhobale. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>Nala walialabana lihengu laka Sapanga ndaba ja posu. Posu yoka sapi kula, lakini ngasapi kula posu jejahenga bangi kujingi mu mahakau. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>Nambanga kukotoka kula inyama, kunywa divai au kuhenga sokapi se sanhenga mundu jujingala mu mahakau. <verse eid="ROM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Henu kamulakia seguhobale kati jaku na Sapanga waku. Jupengaliwi mundu jola, jojuwe hejuamu sukuhenga ngase jupengana na moju waki. <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Lakini ana mundu jubi ni kiholu kupete posu jejukula, jwiikula sindu hesi, ndaba ngase jwalii sukuhobale. Ndaba sokapi se guhengeka bila kuhobale guhenga mahakau.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="s">Mwaahengila aji majambu gaamboni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>Twepani twetubii nukuhobale kokubi nganganganga tupalika twaajangatiya baabi nukuhobale kusokopi ili kuinakali tabu yabu. Wala twalipendale twabeti pena. <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>Kila jumu witu jupalika kunndengane wa pambipi waki kwi indela jukuhenga majambu gaamboni ili juwesa kulibeka nganganganga mu kuhobale. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Ndaba Kilisitu ngase julipendalya mwene, ila jwabii ngati hegapwaga maandiku gaka Sapanga, “Matondu ga bandu babugutondola weapa andondola nepani.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>Ndaba, kila sindu sebikiandiki toka mwandi aandiki ili sutubolisa twepani ndaba tuinakalia nukugangamaliswa mioju kotupata kuhuma mu Maandiku haga, kutuwesisa kuhobale. <verse eid="ROM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>Sapanga jojumpeke mwanganya makili gukuhinakali nukugangamalisa mioju, nundoba ampekiya mwanganya uwesu wa kuba na moju gumu kwa kila jumu winu kati jinu pa mumpwata Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>ili kwa moju gumu na sauti jimu nhwesa kundumbali Sapanga Atati baka Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lijambu la Amboni kwa bandu boti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Ndienu, nnzetakannya mwabe kwa mwabeti ngati Kilisitu hejunzopiki mwanganya ili kunndete Sapanga ulumbi. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Ndaba numpwagi Kilisitu jubi nntumisi wa Ayaudi ili juwesa kulangi usakaka waka Sapanga, nukulangi malagii gaki gajwaapekia aka hoku bitu ba mwandi gawesa kuba ga sakaka, <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/>ili hata bandu ba nndema yoti awesa kundumbali Sapanga ndaba ji ikia yaki. Ngati hegapwaga maandiku gaka Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">“Henu nakulumbalia pikilanda sa bandu banndema yoti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">Nagulumbaliya weapa sukugujembe.” <verse eid="ROM 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>Kabee Maandiku gaka Sapanga gapwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">“Ntogulia mwabandu bandema yoti, ntogulia pamu na bandu baka Sapanga!” <verse eid="ROM 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>Kabee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">“Mwabandu ba ndema yoti munndumbalia Bambu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">mwabandu mwaboa munndumbalia.” <verse eid="ROM 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>Kabee Isaya jupwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">“Jwiipitila mwana mulukolu lwaka Yese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">najombi jwikuba kilongosi wa bandu bandema yoti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">nabombi biitenda kunhobale jombi.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Henu Sapanga jojubii utumbuli ukuhobale, nunndoba juntwelakia kutogule kwoti nu lukwali kulengana nukuhobale kwinu, kuhobale kwinu kujonzukika kupete makili ga Loho jaka Sapanga.<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengu laka Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Mwaalongu bangu nenamwe mi nu uwakika mwanganya kabee ntweli waamboni, umanyi woti, kabee nhwesa kubolana sapi. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Mu balua jenze nunhandaki majambu gingi bila kujogopa ili nhwesa kunkombosa kuhusu majambu gangi. Nhengiki hela ndaba ja waamboni waka Sapanga gojumbeki, <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>kuba ntumisi waka Yesu Kilisitu kwa bandu bandema yoti. Lende lihengu langu lu ugolu lukulandi Lijambu la Amboni laka Sapanga ili bandu bandema yoti awesa kuba litambiku lelijetake na Sapanga, litambiku le lisapisiki na Loho jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Henu koni nyongini na Yesu Kilisitu mii na sukukipuni kupete lihengu langu lukuntumaki Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Ngase nhwesa kupwaga sindu sengi kabee sokapi, ila pe sejutei Kilisitu sukundumi nepani kwa alongo bandu banndema yoti awesa kunzetake Sapanga. Jatenda hela kwa gala ga mbwagiki nukuhenga, <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>kupete makili ga ndonduke na nginyuli, nukupete makili ga Loho jaka Sapanga. Henu suku jenda kila pandu, toka ku Yelusalemu mbaka ku Iluliko, nililandi sapi Lijambu la Amboni laka Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Masoba goha mojuwa gupala nalandi Lijambu la Amboni pandu pokapi pala panga kuwai kujogwaneka lijambu laka Kilisitu, ili niisenga panani junsingi wa mundu jongi. <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/>Ngati he gapwaga Maandiku gaka Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">“Bandu boka banga kwaalandi majambu gaki biitenda kulinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">na bandu banga kujogwa majambu gaki biitenda kumanya.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli jupala kujenda ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Jenze ndi ndaba bambengiki mala jingi niiwesa kuhika kwinu. <verse eid="ROM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Lakini henu, ndaba nyomwi lihengu langu upandi gongoni, na ndaba yaka yingi natokuli ngamaa kuhika kwinu, <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>nhobale henu kuhenga sajenu. Paniibia nyenda ku Sipania nhobale kupete kwiinu nukuketangana na mwanganya nukutogule kidogu pamu na mwanganya kabee nhobale kupata ujangati wii kuhuma kwinu. <verse eid="ROM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Lakini sajenu nyenda hoti kwa atumaki bandu baka Sapanga ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/>Ndaba bandu babunhobale Sapanga buku Makedonia nuku Akaya ahamwi kubaga misangu jabu kwa ajangati bandu baka Sapanga baabi aka kapuku ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/>Bombi beni aamwi kutenda hela, lakini sakaka bapalika kuhenga hela kwa bandu haba. Ndaba, ana bandu banga Ayaudi apatiki mbengale yiki loho yaka Ayaudi, apalika na bombi kwaajangati Ayaudi mahitaji gabu gupundema pani gahapongukiwi nagu. <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Paniijomula lihengu heli na kwaapeke nsangu hogu nampetila mwanganya panibia mwiindela kujenda ku Sipania. <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Nepani manya panihika kwinu nandetila mbengale yaka Kilisitu yingipi.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Henu mwaalongu bangu, nundoba kupete Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu na kupete upali gojuleta Loho, tujangatana ngamaa kunobe kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>Nnobila niwesa kupita sapi kuhuma kwa bandu banga kuhobale baabii ku Yudea, na lihengu langu ku Yelusalemu liwesa kujetakeka na bandu baka Sapanga baabi hoku. <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>Henu Sapanga ana jupai niiwesa kuhika kwinu kwa moju ukutogule ili niiwesa kupomule pamu na mwanganya. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Sapanga jojubii utumbuli ulukwali jubia pamu na mwanganya mwaboha! Amina.<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli jwaalamuki bandu buku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Mbala kummanyisa kwinu nndombu witu Foibe jojubi ntumisi kwa bandu ba bunhobale Kilisitu buku Kenikilea. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>Munzopa ndaba jaka Bambu ngati hekupalika kwa bandu baka Sapanga. Munzangatia sokapi sejwiipala kuhuma kwiinu ndaba jombi jubi jwaamboni ngamaa kwa bandu bingi na kwangu nepani kabee.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>Mwaalamukia aka Pisikila na Akula, baahenga lihengu pamu nanepani kupete utumisi waka Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>Bombi babi tayali kukomeka ndaba jangu nepani. Nganepani pena nenunsengu mwanya ila kabee likundi la bandu ba bunhobale Kilisitu bandema yengi na bombi atenda kunsengu. <verse eid="ROM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>Mwaalamukia kabee bandu bi likundi la bandu ba bunhobale Kilisitu baaketangana ku nyumba jabu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Munndamukia nkosi wangu jonumpai Epatusi jojubii ju utumbuli mu nkoa uku Asia kunhobale Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>Munndamukia Malia jojuhengiki lihengu nga maa kwa ndaba jinu. <verse eid="ROM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Munndamukia Andiloniko na Yunia, Ayaudi ajangu babaakongiki mu ligelesa pamu na nepani, bombi amanyikana ngamaa kati ji mitumi, kabee babi bandu baka Kilisitu kabula jangu nepani.<verse eid="ROM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Munndamukia Ampiliato, nkosi wangu jonumpai kupete kujongana na Bambu. <verse eid="ROM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Munndamukia Ulubani, jojuhenga lihengu pamu nanepani mu utumisi waka Kilisitu, munndamukia kabee nkosi wangu jonumpai Sitaku. <verse eid="ROM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Mundamukia Apele ndaba julangi kuhobale kwaki kupete Kilisitu. Mwaalamukia kabee bandu boti baabii mu nyumba jaka Alisitobulo. <verse eid="ROM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Munndamukia Helodiana, nkolondema nzangu na kwa bandu boka ba bunhobale Kilisitu baatama mu nyumba jaka Nalikisi.<verse eid="ROM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Munndamuki Tulupena na Tulufosa baahenga lihengu mu utumisi waka Bambu, nu nkosi wangu Pelisi jonumpai jojuhengiki majambu gingi ndaba jaka Bambu. <verse eid="ROM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/>Munndamukia Lupu, mundu jojuhenga lihengu laka Bambu ngamaa bila kujogopa, na amabu baki babube na nepani ngati amabu bangu. <verse eid="ROM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>Munndamukia Asunkilito na Pulegoni na Helume na Patuloba na Heluma na alongu boka ba bunhobale Kilisitu baatama pamu naku. <verse eid="ROM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>Munndamukia Pilogo na Yulia na Nelea na nndombu waki na Olimpa pamu na bandu boti baka Sapanga baabi pamu nabu.<verse eid="ROM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>Nndamukania mwabe kwa mwabee kupete nginyuli yu upali. Bandu boti ba bunhobale Kilisitu atenda kunndamuki.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagalaki ga mwisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Mwaalongu bangu nndoba mwaalangia bandu boti baaleta kubaganyika nakwaahenga bandu bangi akotuka kunhobale Sapanga, nukujenda kinyumi na mabole ga muliboliki. Nzepana na bandu haba, <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>ndaba bandu ngati haba ngase buntumaki Kilisitu Bambu witu, ila bagatumaki matumbu gabu beni. Kupete malobi gabu gaasapi na gukukolo, ahoa mioju ja bandu baamboni palongi jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="ROM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Kila mundu jujowini lijambu luku jowane nukuhenga kwinu mu majambu gaamboni, nanepani ndweli nulutogulelu lwiingipi ndaba jinu. Lakini mbala mbia na malangu kupete kuhenga majambu gaamboni mwiikuba na makosa sukuhenga majambu galiya. <verse eid="ROM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Najombi Sapanga jojubii utumbuli ulukwali nga jwiikabaki kuliponda lijobi pai ja magolu giino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Waamboni waka Bambu witu Yesu gubia pamu na mwanganya. Amina.<verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>Timoti jojuhenga lihengu pamu nane, jutenda kunndamuki. Kabee na Lukio na Yasoni na Sosipetili na Ajaudi ajangu atenda kunndamuki.<verse eid="ROM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Nane Taliso, joniandika balua jaka Pauli jenze ndenda kunndamuki kwi liina laka Bambo.<verse eid="ROM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>Gayo mwenei wangu, pamu na bandu boka ba bunhobale Kilisitu baaketangana kunyumba jaki atenda kunndamuki. Elasita jojutunza lupija wa musi goni, pamu na Kwaluto, atenda kunndamuki. <verse eid="ROM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24"/>Waamboni waka Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu ubia pamu na mwanganya mwabao. Amina.<verse eid="ROM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli jujomule suku nndoba Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Henu, tunndumbalia Sapanga! Jombi juwesa kunngangamalisa mwanganya mu Lijambu la Amboni lenandi kupete Yesu Kilisitu na kulengana nukuyekuliwa sili ye yahihiki toka mwandi. <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>Lakini henu usakaka hogu uyekuliwi kupete ndela ja Maandiku gaka alota baka Sapanga. Nukupete Mihilu jaka Sapanga wa yaka petapeta, usakaka hogu ubonakini kwa bandu bandema yoka ili boti awesa kuhobale nu kujetake.<verse eid="ROM 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>Tunndumbalia Sapanga kajika jaki jojubii na malangu, kupete Yesu Kilisitu yaka petapeta. Amina.<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
